# Play test of Sulphur Vent (CIPlay sulphur_vent, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The works on the north shoulder (-7 15, 10.3 m), the vent's cap on the summit (-6 -3, 20.5 m) with the reset lever, the
# boathouse on the north-east beach (x 9..15, z 35.5..44.5, floor 1.05 m; its shutter on the south side).
island Sulphur Vent
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Forty Seconds
wait 5
expect animals Dolphin 2
at -1 20.5 h=11.5
walk -1 20 to -2 16 h=10.3
zone works
expect step 0
read Works manager's note
expect step 1
open Works store box
expect step 2
open Bunkhouse locker
open Sulphur barrel
use ventlever
expect message The case is still on the cap
at -6 0 h=21
zone vent
open Sample case
expect story sample 1
expect step 3
expect shown ventgas
at 12 32.5 h=2.5
walk 12 33 to 12 39.5 h=1.05
zone boathouse
expect step 4
open Works safe
expect done
